# Git push policy (Ruwaq)

After completing any implementation work (features, fixes, UI, i18n, config):

1. Run `npm run build` when code changed; fix failures before pushing.
2. **Commit and push to GitHub without waiting for the user to ask.**
3. Do not push secrets (`.env`, credentials). Never force-push to `main`.
4. Use clear commit messages focused on why the change was made.
5. Only skip push if the user explicitly says not to push in that turn.
